hrm{d}u\" :db/id 17592186680291} {:answer/id #uuid \"4727c2a5-bf5f-50d6-9005-5f068acf5d8e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186680300} {:answer/id #uuid \"7351e569-08e4-54b6-ab30-e2f300bc2306\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186680309} {:answer/id #uuid \"e4f7e472-200e-572b-9514-ee4c78739eff\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{12}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186680333} {:answer/id #uuid \"f61c3de9-46d3-5e8d-a2fb-ab30d2965099\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186680338}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"4727c2a5-bf5f-50d6-9005-5f068acf5d8e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\" :db/id 17592186680300} :answer-field/id #uuid \"a87e38d5-4938-5eab-820c-afbcc34cabfc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186680319}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"f7131eaa-146e-51c1-a2fb-f1a082e72cea\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=x^{3} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int x^{2} e^{x^{3} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int e^{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"}] :knowledge-point/title \"Integrating Products Containing the Exponential Function\"}",
